{"nodes": [{"id": "index_spa_shell", "label": "Single Page App HTML Shell", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L1-L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The served HTML is an empty shell: no server-rendered markup, one mount point, one ES-module script. Everything (routing, catalog, cart) is built client-side, which is why category filtering can be routes without any server route config, but also why the page has no crawlable content or per-route metadata."}, {"id": "index_root", "label": "root Mount Element", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "index_main_entry_script", "label": "src/main.jsx Module Entry", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Loaded as a native ES module from an unbundled /src path, which is the Vite dev-server convention rather than Create React App; the bundler rewrites this path at build time."}, {"id": "index_title_fuegos_artificiales", "label": "Document Title: Fuegos Artificiales", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The storefront is branded as a fireworks shop. A single static title serves every route, so the tab label never reflects the product or category being viewed."}, {"id": "index_favicon_lavadora", "label": "Favicon /lavadora.ico", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Washing-machine icon left over from the original lavadero (laundry/car-wash) concept, and declared with an SVG MIME type while the file is named .ico, a mismatch browsers may refuse."}, {"id": "index_domain_pivot", "label": "Domain Pivot: Lavadero to Fuegos Artificiales", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L5,L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The project was retargeted from a laundry/car-wash business to a fireworks store, but the rebrand was partial: the repository directory and the favicon asset still carry the lavadero identity while the page title carries the new one. The generic ecommerce architecture (Firestore items plus categories) made the pivot cheap, which is likely why only surface strings were changed."}, {"id": "index_lang_attribute_mismatch", "label": "Shell lang=en on Spanish Storefront", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The shell declares English while the title, documentation and UI copy are Spanish, an untouched scaffold default that misinforms screen readers and translation heuristics."}], "edges": [{"source": "index_main_entry_script", "target": "index_root", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L10-L11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_spa_shell", "target": "index_root", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_spa_shell", "target": "index_main_entry_script", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_domain_pivot", "target": "index_title_fuegos_artificiales", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_domain_pivot", "target": "index_favicon_lavadora", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_favicon_lavadora", "target": "index_title_fuegos_artificiales", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.2, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L5,L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_lang_attribute_mismatch", "target": "index_title_fuegos_artificiales", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L2,L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_lang_attribute_mismatch", "target": "index_spa_shell", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_main_entry_script", "target": "readme_react", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_spa_shell", "target": "readme_react_router_dom", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L9-L12", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_ecommerce_react", "target": "index_root", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_spa_shell", "target": "readme_react_spinners", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.7, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L9-L12", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_domain_pivot", "target": "readme_catalogo_de_productos", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "